## Operasional
- CI: `.github/workflows/deploy.yml` — push main → build → rsync (sudo) → restart systemd
- GitHub secrets: VPS_SSH_KEY, VPS_HOST, VPS_USER (nvnrchmn)
- Env prod: `/etc/logikraf-export.env` (600) — DB, JWT, ADMIN (admin@logikraf.id / admin123)
- Vhost: `/www/server/panel/vhost/nginx/export.logikraf.id.conf` (80+443, proxy 8091)

## Aturan
- Sprint staged: selesai + **verified** (tool output nyata), auto commit + push
- Build di GitHub Actions (bukan di VPS), rsync deploy, systemd restart
- **Ponytail config FULL** sebelum merge
- Secret (DB_DSN, JWT_SECRET, ADMIN_EMAIL, ADMIN_PASSWORD) hanya di `/etc/logikraf-export.env` — TIDAK di git/config
- Jangan edit `/etc/nginx/nginx.conf` (aaPanel handle vhost)
